    "## Decorator \n",
    "\n",
    "A decorator is a function that \n",
    "- Taking another function as input \n",
    "- adds extra behavior before or after the function runs \n",
    "- returns a modified version of that function \n",
    "\n",
    "The decorators are built on 2 things \n",
    "- First-class functions -> Functions can be passed as argument "
   ]
